WEBVTT

00:10:59.236 --> 00:11:02.356
and saying, "This policy
shouldn't happen,"

00:11:02.396 --> 00:11:04.196
or, "This research needs to be done

00:11:04.236 --> 00:11:06.796
to show why we shouldn't
go down this path,"

00:11:06.796 --> 00:11:08.516
or in the world that we both are in,

00:11:08.556 --> 00:11:11.036
just three people coming together
to start a company.

00:11:11.076 --> 00:11:14.476
So I think our generation
is jumping full into this, Lindsay.

00:11:14.516 --> 00:11:15.916
We can't wait to work with --

00:11:15.916 --> 00:11:17.356
LL: Brilliant. We wish you --

00:11:17.996 --> 00:11:20.876
JD: Let's do this with speed and scale.

00:11:20.916 --> 00:11:22.076
LL: Speed and scale.

00:11:22.116 --> 00:11:24.316
And we wish you
the very best with the plan.

00:11:24.356 --> 00:11:25.996
Thank you, thank you.

00:11:26.036 --> 00:11:28.436
(Applause)